BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
DTSTART:20261110T170000Z
DTEND:20261110T180000Z
LOCATION:LOWELL E. BAIER HALL/IU MAURER SCHOOL OF LAW
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
SUMMARY:Aeronautics to Toast: A Broad Patent Practice with Mark A. Davis
DESCRIPTION:CIPR and the IPA are pleased to welcome  Mark A. Davis\, Part
 ner at McGarry Bair PC!  Drawing on a career that spans everything from c
 ooling gas turbine aircraft engines to the mechanics of toasting bread\, 
 Mr. Davis will share practical career advice\, key industry knowledge\, a
 nd anecdotes from his broad legal practice.  He will highlight the divers
 e and unconventional technologies he has patented over the years\, alongs
 ide a brief tour of history's most famously oddball patents.  This sessio
 n is highly recommended for students interested in intellectual property\
 , patent prosecution\, engineering and technology law\, or anyone curious
  about how adaptable a legal career can be.  RSVP by November 9th at noon
 .&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  CIPR and the IPA are pleased to welcome
 <br />  Mark A. Davis\, Partner at McGarry Bair PC!</p><p>  Drawing on a 
 career that spans everything from cooling gas turbine aircraft engines to
  the mechanics of toasting bread\, Mr. Davis will share practical career 
 advice\, key industry knowledge\, and anecdotes from his broad legal prac
 tice.<br />  He will highlight the diverse and unconventional technologie
 s he has patented over the years\, alongside a brief tour of history's mo
 st famously oddball patents.</p><p>  This session is highly recommended f
 or students interested in intellectual property\, patent prosecution\, en
 gineering and technology law\, or anyone curious about how adaptable a le
 gal career can be.</p><p>  RSVP by November 9th at noon.&#160\;</p>
UID:20261110T170000Z-2433057@events.iu.edu
