SUMMARY:Environmental Justice & Racism
DESCRIPTION:Join ELS\, BLSA\, and PILF for a discussion of Environmental 
 Justice and Racism in America. Professors David Konisky and Cydney McGuir
 e of the O'Neill School will lead the discussion. Environmental Racism re
 fers to the phenomenon of disparate environmental impacts on communities 
 of color in America. Come learn more! Lunch will be provided.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join ELS\, BLSA\, and PILF for a discus
 sion of Environmental Justice and Racism in America. Professors David Kon
 isky and Cydney McGuire of the O'Neill School will lead the discussion. E
 nvironmental Racism refers to the phenomenon of disparate environmental i
 mpacts on communities of color in America. Come learn more! Lunch will be
  provided.</p>
