BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Maurer School of Law
DTSTART:20261117T170000Z
DTEND:20261117T180000Z
LOCATION:Lowell E. Baier Hall - Lecture Room - 121
GEO:39.165074;-86.526424
SUMMARY:The Evolving Landscape of College Athlete Compensation: A Convers
 ation with Libby Harmon
DESCRIPTION:Join the Sports &amp\; Entertainment Law Society (SELS) for a
  lunch time conversation with a locally based sports law attorney\, Libby
  Harmon.  Libby Harmon\, Senior Counsel at Nervius Legal\, represents ath
 letes\, leagues\, and brands shaping the future of sports on complex inve
 stigations\, eligibility cases\, commercial transactions\, and regulatory
  strategy matters. Before joining Nervius Legal\, she previously worked a
 s the Director of Compliance at the University of Michigan and before tha
 t she worked as the Associate Director of Enforcement at the NCAA.&#160\;
   Come learn about working with college athletes\, NIL\, athletic complia
 nce\, sports gambling\, Title IX\, the intersection of business and sport
 s law\, and more!  RSVP by 10 AM on November 16th.&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join the Sports &amp\; Entertainment La
 w Society (SELS) for a lunch time conversation with a locally based sport
 s law attorney\, Libby Harmon.</p><p>  Libby Harmon\, Senior Counsel at N
 ervius Legal\, represents athletes\, leagues\, and brands shaping the fut
 ure of sports on complex investigations\, eligibility cases\, commercial 
 transactions\, and regulatory strategy matters. Before joining Nervius Le
 gal\, she previously worked as the Director of Compliance at the Universi
 ty of Michigan and before that she worked as the Associate Director of En
 forcement at the NCAA.&#160\;</p><p>  Come learn about working with colle
 ge athletes\, NIL\, athletic compliance\, sports gambling\, Title IX\, th
 e intersection of business and sports law\, and more!</p><p>  RSVP by 10 
 AM on November 16th.&#160\;</p>
UID:20261117T170000Z-2454513@events.iu.edu
DTSTAMP:20261016T184610Z
